{"unit_id":"ken95573__dsh-model-show#card-zh","repo":"ken95573/dsh-model-show","commit":"7eac2496ca62f4716624a9b68897fa4baf9adad0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-show 是面向 DSH Web 的模型选择器界面插件。它接管对话输入框中的模型席位，在当前模型名称前显示配置中的供应商名称，组成“供应商/模型”，并保留已有的思考档位文字。下拉菜单仍按供应商分组并显示原模型名，搜索也继续使用原名称；选择器还会组合 DSH 和其他插件提供的标签装饰。它适合需要在模型较多时辨认当前模型来源的 DSH Web 用户。需要兼容范围内的 DSH，并保持内置模型选择与模型标签插件启用；无需额外密钥或网络服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1195-1213","lib/client.js:2027-2038","lib/client.js:2130-2145"]}
{"unit_id":"ken95573__dsh-model-show#card-en","repo":"ken95573/dsh-model-show","commit":"7eac2496ca62f4716624a9b68897fa4baf9adad0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-model-show adds the provider name before the selected model in the DSH Web composer. The dropdown keeps provider groups, plain model names, and native search. It needs compatible DSH and the built-in model-selection and label plugins.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1195-1213","lib/client.js:2027-2038","lib/client.js:2130-2145"]}
