{"unit_id":"ken95573__dsh-model-show#feature-1","repo":"ken95573/dsh-model-show","commit":"7eac2496ca62f4716624a9b68897fa4baf9adad0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-show 的功能「供应商/模型标签」：在对话输入框的当前模型名称前加上模型所属供应商名称，让触发器显示“供应商/模型”；模型带思考档位时仍显示档位。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1195-1213","lib/client.js:1445-1448"]}
{"unit_id":"ken95573__dsh-model-show#feature-2","repo":"ken95573/dsh-model-show","commit":"7eac2496ca62f4716624a9b68897fa4baf9adad0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-show 的功能「保留原生菜单与搜索」：下拉列表继续按供应商分组显示原模型名，搜索匹配模型原名，提供商前缀只用于当前选择器触发器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1195-1215"]}
{"unit_id":"ken95573__dsh-model-show#feature-3","repo":"ken95573/dsh-model-show","commit":"7eac2496ca62f4716624a9b68897fa4baf9adad0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-show 的功能「组合模型标签装饰」：选择器重用 DSH 的模型标签装饰，并把其他插件注册的装饰一并显示；每个装饰独立挂载并由错误边界隔离。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2044-2057","lib/client.js:2067-2116"]}
{"unit_id":"ken95573__dsh-model-show#feature-4","repo":"ken95573/dsh-model-show","commit":"7eac2496ca62f4716624a9b68897fa4baf9adad0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-show 的功能「接管模型席位」：客户端插件接入共享的 modelDirectories 服务，并以低优先级注册对话输入框的模型席位，使自定义触发器使用 DSH 当前会话的模型目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2130-2145"]}
{"unit_id":"ken95573__dsh-model-show#caveat-1","repo":"ken95573/dsh-model-show","commit":"7eac2496ca62f4716624a9b68897fa4baf9adad0","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-model-show 使用 DSH Web 专用的模型席位；需要兼容范围内的 DSH，并依赖内置模型选择与模型标签插件提供的目录和徽标能力。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2130-2145","README.md:40-46"]}
